{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RP29 approved as written on 2026-09-01. Extend the public-API snapshot to serialize stable normalized return annotations plus an explicit unannotated sentinel, regenerate the baseline, and add a held-out return-only drift case. The implementation must account for the recorded cross-Python normalization risk."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788301856353510001,"uuid":"37e3a562-aa7a-45cb-936b-221edb3f09c9"}